53
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:33,800
internet, you do it by, you send a message by writing to a socket and you accept

54
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:42,320
incoming communication by reading from a socket. And so the same low-level API is the same

55
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:47,640
whether you're reading or writing files on your disk drive or sending packets over

56
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:58,320
the internet. So the core operations then associated with files, of course,

57
00:05:58,320 --> 00:06:03,200
are opening and closing them and reading and writing them.

