00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:14,400
position. So again, if you imagine when you're reading from a file, you don't want

60
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:18,600
to always start at the beginning every time you do a read. You you read some

61
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:23,920
data and then you read some more data. And so that's a tracked by a file position,

