00:07:01,050 --> 00:07:07,250
been typed yet. So there's some kinds of files have a file position in seeking and others don't.

69
00:07:07,250 --> 00:07:13,210
Similarly to a network socket. You can't jump a socket for it in time. You can only

70
00:07:13,210 --> 00:07:21,720
read or write the particular packets as they come in. But in general, think of it then as the file

