00:14:14,820 --> 00:14:19,620
and identify one particular one.

145
00:14:19,620 --> 00:14:27,620
And so that all comes to say that the low-level Unix operations that you use to implement this

146
00:14:27,620 --> 00:14:31,620
are to open a file, to read it, and write it, and to close it.

147
00:14:31,620 --> 00:14:34,650
And those, literally, those are the names of the functions.

