00:15:25,740 --> 00:15:32,830
a integer code that says what do you want to do when you open this file, in what

161
00:15:32,830 --> 00:15:38,570
form do you want to open it? And that's specified by a series of constants that are

162
00:15:38,570 --> 00:15:42,970
already predefined when you include the proper files.

