00:17:35,930 --> 00:17:42,630
than 1,024 files open at any given time. And, in fact, if you've got 1,024 files open,

181
00:17:42,630 --> 00:17:45,470
it's a chance you're doing something really seriously wrong.

182
00:17:45,550 --> 00:17:49,550
Meaning that you haven't been closing the files, you should be closing.

183
00:17:49,550 --> 00:18:05,770
And all of the system calls, including these, always have a return code.

184
00:18:05,770 --> 00:18:11,770
And the return codes vary, sometimes a negative number is an error, sometimes a zero is an error.

